extends layout

block content
	h1= title
	p Welcome to #[em Local IMDb], a very basic Express website developed as a tutorial example on the Mozilla Developer Network.
	
	h2 Dynamic content

	p The IMDb has the following record counts:
	div(class='lists')
		ul
			li #[strong Reviews:] !{review_count}
			li #[strong Films:] !{film_count}
			li #[strong Directors:] !{director_count}
			li #[strong Genres:] !{genre_count}
